      "vision_reason": "The image shows ceramic tile panels from Dar Hussein in the Tunis Medina, made by Kallaline potters in the traditional Tunisian style; though category is labeled \"photo,\" the actual subject is Tunisian ceramic architectural decoration, fitting the claimed Tunisian Arab ethnicity.",
